    rdf:value """Monday, July 30, 1906
Fine.
Fernhurst
Settling in. Saw Grace’s cottage. Van Bridge.
Dr. and Mrs. Duke called.
Tuesday, July 31, 1906
Fine.
Fernhurst
Went to town - met Karin - saw doctor. Met Alys – shopped - Came down.
Wednesday, Aug. 1, 1906
Fine.
Fernhurst
B.B. at St. Moritz.
Alys here. Talk. Walks. Games of Patience."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 104 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1906> .

